# Wario Land 4 (USA, Europe): title screen to Entry Passage, Wario in play (gate G9, route depth).
# Start at frame 300 then A at 340, alternating every 40 frames to frame 4200 (title, file select, passage, the level's opening), then no key.
# The level (hearts, coin counter, Wario next to the spinning flower) is in play from about frame 4200 and stays in it, idle, to the
# end; the picture keeps moving a little (Wario's idle animation, the enemies), so equal pictures are not expected. For the delivered player with no save.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
